{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "I Lost my Eggs: Easter",
    "steam_appid": 3286880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286880/extras/76b526b0c86db731924af94393ae2b8a.avif?t=1744224732\" width=600 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter is here, and someone hid all the eggs! Embark on an adorable adventure, exploring every corner of a charming church. Search through seven magical rooms, open doors, move objects, and uncover secrets while hunting for the lost eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need a little help, answer cute Easter-themed questions \u2014 get them right and receive a special hint to continue your hunt. Can you find them all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286880/extras/4a8290be54dfa7fc1dc1290921858196.avif?t=1744224732\" width=600 height=209 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Egg Hunt:</strong> Look in unexpected places and discover hidden spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Easter Trivia:</strong> Answer true or false questions to earn helpful hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven Rooms to Explore:</strong> Each environment holds colorful surprises and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family-Friendly Fun:</strong> Perfect for kids and adults to enjoy together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sweetest Easter adventure is waiting for you. Let\u2019s go egg hunting!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286880/extras/76b526b0c86db731924af94393ae2b8a.avif?t=1744224732\" width=600 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter is here, and someone hid all the eggs! Embark on an adorable adventure, exploring every corner of a charming church. Search through seven magical rooms, open doors, move objects, and uncover secrets while hunting for the lost eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need a little help, answer cute Easter-themed questions \u2014 get them right and receive a special hint to continue your hunt. Can you find them all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286880/extras/4a8290be54dfa7fc1dc1290921858196.avif?t=1744224732\" width=600 height=209 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Egg Hunt:</strong> Look in unexpected places and discover hidden spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Easter Trivia:</strong> Answer true or false questions to earn helpful hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven Rooms to Explore:</strong> Each environment holds colorful surprises and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family-Friendly Fun:</strong> Perfect for kids and adults to enjoy together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sweetest Easter adventure is waiting for you. Let\u2019s go egg hunting!</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a fun Easter egg hunt! Explore seven enchanting rooms, solve fun Easter trivia, and uncover hidden eggs in the most unexpected places. Can you find them all? The hunt is on!",
